## Interpretations

- V8: Track00060 30-90 s stereo, block 256 (= one hop), host wall time of pvb_process summed per run, min over 3 interleaved runs per build; worst hop time = per-256-sample-block time (one hop plus the rest of the chain) max, median over runs

